# Owlin Historian: "When this creature enters, surveil 1" puts the top Island into Bot1's graveyard beside the Lightning
# Bolt it cast; "Whenever one or more cards leave your graveyard, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn" is one trigger
# for the two cards a Soaring Stoneglider exiles at once (CR 603.2c), so it is 3/4 and not 4/5, and 2/3 again afterwards.

